WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,440
And when we went to gather the residents of Liuli Shisuo around today,

2
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:06,120
Found a place where they killed more than a dozen people

3
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:07,880
Are you serious?

4
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,600
I suspect that although they withdrew their troops

5
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:12,800
But consciously massacre the surroundings into a barren land.

6
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,120
We continue to be unable to accommodate new people

7
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:16,800
There's no way to get in touch with anyone else, General.

8
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,280
We can't go on like this

9
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:20,120
You said there are only a dozen people in Qinglong Village

10
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:21,320
According to our observation, this is the case

11
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:22,600
I sent people to investigate

12
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,760
Chi Qiu came back to report like this. Do you know where it is?

13
00:00:24,760 --> 00:00:26,640
Qinglong Mountain, eighty miles away from us

14
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:29,280
I'll take you to Qinglong Mountain

15
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,920
I'll go to the room to change clothes first and we'll go to the right place

16
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:35,400
Aren't you curious whether this iron horse can run? I'll take you there.

17
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:41,950
What do you know? It’s so loud. There’s a light general there.

18
00:00:41,950 --> 00:00:46,670
That's General Xiao. It's really General Xiao. What is this horse riding? There aren't four of them. Look.

19
00:00:46,670 --> 00:00:49,150
Those are two round things. Are they pure wheels? General?

20
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:51,790
This iron horse is so powerful

21
00:00:51,790 --> 00:00:54,710
I'll take you to Qinglong Village and kill their good general.

22
00:00:54,710 --> 00:00:56,870
They definitely wouldn't have thought that we could surprise them.

23
00:00:56,870 --> 00:00:59,230
They know that our war horses have already been defeated and left.

24
00:00:59,230 --> 00:01:00,390
It's hard for us to vent our anger now

25
00:01:00,390 --> 00:01:01,470
Meet them technically
